  <p id="c-liangshu-006-peizhiheng-dongguan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">三月，齊遣其<persName id="c-liangshu-006-peizhiheng-dongguan:p001:m0006" ref="2c0_xgj_5n3">上黨王高渙</persName>送<persName id="c-liangshu-006-peizhiheng-dongguan:p001:m0012" ref="qvt_eq1_lcf_ACA">貞陽侯蕭淵明</persName>來主梁嗣，至東關，遣吳興太守<persName id="c-liangshu-006-peizhiheng-dongguan:p001:m0032" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD">裴之橫</persName>與戰，敗績，<persName id="c-liangshu-006-peizhiheng-dongguan:p001:m0041" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_AAD">之橫</persName>死。</p>
</text>
